  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_wicker_bottle_cb292700685da41d30eb52593ee936e846da2e3415d543d642b2b1cd0b6498a20e">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>bottle, wrapped in wicker for protection | bottle covered with wicker, a pliant twig or small rod, usually of willow, especially as used for making baskets, chiefly used in plural to designate wickerwork, a basket, cradle, chair etc. made of wicker (OED s.v. wicker n.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
